# Plugin builds

Release plugin build:

```bash
cargo xtask bundle composure --release
```

After a successful bundle, install CLAP to the user plugins folder (macOS):

```bash
mkdir -p ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/CLAP/
cp -R target/bundled/composure.clap ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/CLAP/
```

`cargo xtask bundle` runs this install step automatically on macOS when the CLAP bundle exists.

When asked to compile or build the plugin, use the bundle command above—not plain `cargo build`.
